        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Children's Future&quot; is a short visual novel/adventure game set in a rural elementary school. Players explore the school and advance the story by clicking on areas of interest. The game has a playtime of approximately one hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Supported Languages </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game currently only supports Japanese/English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234540/extras/64d4de7e38dfdca3edf3d88afd318755.avif?t=1766674821\" width=1277 height=720 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Story Overview </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in Country J, a fictional country located in the center of the Eurasian continent. You, the protagonist, work as a teacher at a rural elementary school in Country J. But one day, you suddenly realize that your familiar school building has been transformed into a world different from reality. A mysterious space with no exit in sight. Time seems to have stopped. A school building filled with only silence. In an attempt to return to your original world, you begin exploring the elementary school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234540/extras/1375ba0f1095c1b4aa885b0608da92aa.avif?t=1766674821\" width=1279 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Game System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploratory adventure where you click to investigate interesting locations Collecting clues hidden around the school advances the story Finding &quot;dolls&quot; of students and colleagues changes the ending Playable with just a mouse Compatible with Windows (x86)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234540/extras/e59470bb390728e991bded82129f6afa.avif?t=1766674821\" width=1287 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Features </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tranquil yet slightly mysterious world set in an elementary school Simple controls and a short story Multiple endings depending on your exploration Explore a silent elementary school and attempt to escape from another world in this short adventure. Collect clues and experience changing endings.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Children's Future&quot; is a short visual novel/adventure game set in a rural elementary school. Players explore the school and advance the story by clicking on areas of interest. The game has a playtime of approximately one hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Supported Languages </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game currently only supports Japanese/English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234540/extras/64d4de7e38dfdca3edf3d88afd318755.avif?t=1766674821\" width=1277 height=720 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Story Overview </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in Country J, a fictional country located in the center of the Eurasian continent. You, the protagonist, work as a teacher at a rural elementary school in Country J. But one day, you suddenly realize that your familiar school building has been transformed into a world different from reality. A mysterious space with no exit in sight. Time seems to have stopped. A school building filled with only silence. In an attempt to return to your original world, you begin exploring the elementary school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234540/extras/1375ba0f1095c1b4aa885b0608da92aa.avif?t=1766674821\" width=1279 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Game System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploratory adventure where you click to investigate interesting locations Collecting clues hidden around the school advances the story Finding &quot;dolls&quot; of students and colleagues changes the ending Playable with just a mouse Compatible with Windows (x86)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234540/extras/e59470bb390728e991bded82129f6afa.avif?t=1766674821\" width=1287 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Features </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tranquil yet slightly mysterious world set in an elementary school Simple controls and a short story Multiple endings depending on your exploration Explore a silent elementary school and attempt to escape from another world in this short adventure. Collect clues and experience changing endings.</p>",
